      "text": "[6:28PM] #Idumota #TrafficUpdate \n\nFree flow of traffic in and out of Adeniji Adele road through Oba's Palace and Police Post.\n\nIdumota underneath the bridge inward Eyin Eyo connecting Balogun street is moving slowly due to market activities.\n\nReturn journey from Tinubu Square connecting Nnamdi Azikiwe street enroute Tom Jones intersection is also busy due to high influx. \n\nIlubinrin connecting Carter bridge inward Ijora Olopa as well as Oyingbo is good.\n\n#FollowLASTMA",
