      "text": "[6:46PM] #LekkiPeninsula #TrafficUpdate \n\nTraffic is currently busy from VFS to Ikate Gate due to congestion at Ikate Traffic Light intersection.\nHowever, movement is smooth from Dome to Zenith and from Zenith to Lekki-Ikoyi Link Bridge roundabout.\nThe road from Lekki-Ikoyi Link Bridge to Alexander Avenue is good, but the return journey to the roundabout is slow due to traffic and speed breakers.\nMovement from the roundabout to Lekki Peninsula Scheme 1 Gate is smooth. No major impediments reported.\n\n#FollowLASTMA",
